{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/algorithm/LEET/L637AverageofLevelsinBinaryTree/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"frontmatter":{"title":"637. Average of Levels in Binary Tree","date":"November 10, 2025"},"html":"<h1>문제 설명</h1>\n<p>이 문제는 이진 트리가 주어지면 각 레벨의 평균값을 구하는 문제다. 딱 봤을 때 층별로 뭔가 하라고 하면 보통 BFS를 쓰고 BFS를 쓰면 큐(deque)를 쓰면 된다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 800px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 73.00000000000001%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"637\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/423e37fd0aca125e03f3cfce4ca15ff9/5a190/637.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/423e37fd0aca125e03f3cfce4ca15ff9/772e8/637.png 200w,\n/static/423e37fd0aca125e03f3cfce4ca15ff9/e17e5/637.png 400w,\n/static/423e37fd0aca125e03f3cfce4ca15ff9/5a190/637.png 800w,\n/static/423e37fd0aca125e03f3cfce4ca15ff9/c1b63/637.png 1200w,\n/static/423e37fd0aca125e03f3cfce4ca15ff9/c8ad9/637.png 1564w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<h2>풀이 및 해설</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>deque를 이용하여 BFS를 Level Order Traversal (left-right) 방식으로 구하면 된다.</li>\n<li>각 레벨마다 노드의 값을 더하고, 노드의 개수로 나누어 평균을 구한다.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>풀이</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\"># Definition for a binary tree node.\n# class TreeNode:\n#     def __init__(self, val=0, left=None, right=None):\n#         self.val = val\n#         self.left = left\n#         self.right = right\nclass Solution:\n    def averageOfLevels(self, root: Optional[TreeNode]) -> List[float]:\n        if not root:\n            return []\n        \n        queue = deque([root])\n        res = []\n\n        while queue:\n            level_size = len(queue)\n            current_level = 0\n\n            for _ in range(level_size):\n                node = queue.popleft()\n                current_level += node.val\n\n                if node.left:\n                    queue.append(node.left)\n                if node.right:\n                    queue.append(node.right)\n            \n            res.append(current_level/level_size)\n        \n        return res\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Complexity Analysis</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 800px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 52%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"c\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/5097532c268ba1bb058bac8d3149bb4d/5a190/c.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/5097532c268ba1bb058bac8d3149bb4d/772e8/c.png 200w,\n/static/5097532c268ba1bb058bac8d3149bb4d/e17e5/c.png 400w,\n/static/5097532c268ba1bb058bac8d3149bb4d/5a190/c.png 800w,\n/static/5097532c268ba1bb058bac8d3149bb4d/c1b63/c.png 1200w,\n/static/5097532c268ba1bb058bac8d3149bb4d/dca52/c.png 1550w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<h3>시간 복잡도</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>O(N)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>공간 복잡도</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>O(N)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Constraint Analysis</h2>\n<pre><code>Constraints:\nThe number of nodes in the tree is in the range [1, 10^4].\n-2^31 &#x3C;= Node.val &#x3C;= 2^31 - 1\n</code></pre>\n<h1>References</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/average-of-levels-in-binary-tree/description/?envType=study-plan-v2&#x26;envId=top-interview-150\">LeetCode - 637. Average of Levels in Binary Tree</a></li>\n</ul>"}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/algorithm/LEET/L637AverageofLevelsinBinaryTree/"}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}